Package: bioscR
Title: Utilities for Single-Cell RNA Sequencing Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("zuoanjian", email = "dnf.zuoanjian@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides convenient utilities for common single-cell RNA
    sequencing analysis workflows. The initial functionality detects and
    optionally removes doublets from 'Seurat' objects using 'scDblFinder',
    while preserving doublet classifications in cell-level metadata.
